      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T14:41:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unlike the break iterator tokenizer, this one is shared for the whole ICU instance.  Poking around, I think the expectation is that SkICU entry points are thread-safe.  So if we\u0027re going to use this global tokenizer we\u0027ll need to add some synchronization.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 549,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 549,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "19e77d3cdf685fdd63155715fa459abbad614465",
