      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T15:37:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we ever signed up for SkUnicode/SkParagraph to be thread-safe. In fact, I know that the paragraph is not. Also, Gemini analyzed all Flutter usages of SkParagraph/SkUnicode and they never act on assumption that this is thread-safe.\nIn general I am not against it but it comes with a price and I don\u0027t think that we should pay it with an ask.",
      "parentUuid": "78ec9e28_4d4ce32d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 549,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 549,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "19e77d3cdf685fdd63155715fa459abbad614465",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
